error[RB0317]: `call reserve` is the type of a pending call, which only a machine variable can hold
 --> RB0317-call-type-not-allowed.road:1:16
  |
1 | type Pending = call reserve
  |                ^^^^^^^^^^^^
  |
  = help: a pending call never leaves its run: keep it in a `var` of type `call <name>` (not optional, not a list, not through an alias) and answer it with `reply`

