error[RB0317]: `c` holds a pending call, so it has no initial value
  --> RB0317-call-type-not-allowed.road:10:25
   |
10 |   var c: call reserve = 1
   |                         ^
   |
   = help: it starts unassigned; `set c = call` in an `on reserve` transition gives it one

